---
/**
 * Light only: the design system has no dark tokens. Starlight hardcodes
 * `data-theme="dark"`, and its code-block theme keys off that attribute.
 */
---

{/* Inlined, and in <head>, so the attribute is set before the first paint. */}
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = "light"
</script>
